<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to provide for certain matters relating to
the election of Senators for New South Wales; and for other
purposes.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>long title:</b> Am 2007
No 1, Sch 1 [1].</txt></content>
</tier>
