<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1903-009" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Senators&#8217; Elections Act
1903</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


